ía. La ausencia materna se convierte en una herida profunda, pero, a medida que se acerca la Navidad, la promesa de un reencuentro empieza a tomar forma.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1472813","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-17T11:01:46.907Z"},{"id":"movie-1202033","slug":"movie-1202033","title":"Enola Holmes 3","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cepT0wSQPvynDDYAM8tHjxa1Quk.jpg","synopsis":"Las aventuras de la detective Enola Holmes continúan en Malta, donde sus planes de boda se complican cuando Sherlock desaparece y ella se ve envuelta en un peligroso caso.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Aventura","Crimen","Misterio"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1202033","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-17T11:01:47.201Z"},{"id":"movie-1124620","slug":"movie-1124620","title":"The Monkey","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eEhZyX9s15RRjDZ358GNNQRBMWs.jpg","synopsis":"Cuando dos hermanos gemelos encuentran un misterioso mono de cuerda, una serie de muertes atroces separan a su familia. Veinticinco años después, el mono comienza una nueva matanza que obliga a los hermanos a enfrentarse al juguete maldito.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror","Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1124620","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-17T11:01:49.662Z"},{"id":"movie-1622764","slug":"movie-1622764","title":"Broad Trip","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8gGtvGzwyQIZeHECopX9OeLPjYH.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Comedia","Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1622764","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-17T11:01:49.958Z"},{"id":"movie-1035259","slug":"movie-1035259","title":"Ag