entarse a sus propias pérdidas y hacer sacrificios definitivos para restaurar el equilibrio del universo.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Aventura","Ciencia ficción","Acción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/299534","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2019,"updatedAt":"2026-10-17T11:01:53.176Z"},{"id":"movie-1084199","slug":"movie-1084199","title":"La acompañante","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nyloao2GWttUvS7KVcEM2eSDwUn.jpg","synopsis":"La muerte de un multimillonario desencadena una serie de acontecimientos para Iris y sus amigos durante un viaje de fin de semana a su finca junto al lago.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror","Ciencia ficción","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1084199","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-17T11:01:53.468Z"},{"id":"movie-1628071","slug":"movie-1628071","title":"宗师叶问2","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qU4xOstFQo3mZNfoKEWehA6t8Un.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1628071","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-17T11:01:53.764Z"},{"id":"movie-1444595","slug":"movie-1444595","title":"Pioneras: solo querían jugar","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/coXlNNeiySibclnnqzHOuQIqGm.jpg","synopsis":"España, años setenta. A pesar de que la ideología franquista siguen profundamente arraigada en la sociedad, un grupo de jóvenes pioneras y un promotor ambicioso están a punto de cambiar la historia del fútbol femenino.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1444595","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-17T11:01:54.056Z"},{"id":"movie-1001405","slug":"movie-1001405","title":"L'Espèce explosive","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hOB3qNerO