s, Peter regresa a casa, donde vive con su tía. Bajo la atenta mirada de su mentor Tony Stark, Peter intenta mantener una vida normal como cualquier joven de su edad, pero interrumpe en su rutina diaria el nuevo villano Vulture y, con él, lo más importante de la vida de Peter comenzará a verse amenazado.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Aventura","Ciencia ficción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/315635","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2017,"updatedAt":"2026-10-17T11:05:31.675Z"},{"id":"movie-1613169","slug":"movie-1613169","title":"Looking at Madness","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xp65BEfb933O3NDDHgg2wXHl5ag.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1613169","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-17T11:05:31.972Z"},{"id":"movie-1248226","slug":"movie-1248226","title":"Juegos de niños","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sWhglhFoGA0T7n5U6Yi0t8LBGjA.jpg","synopsis":"Brian acaba de ser despedido de su trabajo, y se convierte en un padre que se queda en casa. Acepta una invitación para jugar de otro padre, que resulta ser un bala perdida.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1248226","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-17T11:05:32.261Z"},{"id":"movie-1731144","slug":"movie-1731144","title":"Lunok","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/x5sqdpvmBnbNCzSyyybfxco1g6f.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1731144","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-17T11:05:32.557Z"},{"id":"movie-1711808","slug":"movie-1711808","title":"Grin","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qgkbvV1VQyQwofv9dU8PSX5y6bX.jpg","synopsis":null,