in embargo, debido a su precaria salud, fue rechazado una y otra vez. Enternecido por sus súplicas, el general Chester Phillips le ofrece la oportunidad de tomar parte en un experimento especial: la Operación Renacimiento. Tras meses de preparación y entrenamiento recibe su primera misión como Capitán América. Armado con un escudo indestructible y su inteligencia para la batalla, el Capitán América emprende la guerra contra el mal, como centinela de la libertad y como líder de los Vengadores.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Aventura","Ciencia ficción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1771","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2011,"updatedAt":"2026-10-17T11:06:25.207Z"},{"id":"movie-1083624","slug":"movie-1083624","title":"수능, 출제의 비밀","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ohrJjtvKciICoeH80z973JnBoHo.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1083624","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-17T11:06:25.506Z"},{"id":"movie-1741752","slug":"movie-1741752","title":"超宇宙刑事ギャバン インフィニティVSライヤ","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vqExTP9KJhier7emmYKTDyEmCaw.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Post Production","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Aventura","Ciencia ficción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1741752","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-17T11:06:25.814Z"},{"id":"movie-1247038","slug":"movie-1247038","title":"Para Perasuk","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ipyK7A2rXwcnHXGVWGK9iJDDT8h.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1247038","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-17T11:06:26.106Z"},{"id":"movie-962640","slug":"movie-962640","title":"ಕೆ.ಜಿ.ಎಫ್: Chapter 3","image":"https://image.