:"movie-1502943","title":"Night of the Reaper","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bTcEFh3OEXFqjiQ3TxZ0XRACZ5w.jpg","synopsis":"En un tranquilo suburbio de los 80, una niñera es asesinada por un misterioso enmascarado conocido como el “Reaper”. Años después, Deena, una joven universitaria, regresa a su pueblo y acepta cuidar al hijo del sheriff local, sin saber que el asesino ha vuelto. Mientras el sheriff recibe inquietantes cintas con pistas del pasado, Deena se convierte en el nuevo objetivo del Reaper, desatando una noche de terror y revelaciones sobre una venganza oculta.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1502943","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-17T11:08:38.634Z"},{"id":"movie-1578488","slug":"movie-1578488","title":"Merry Christmas Aubrey Flint","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/A8kYK3hODhQyNNxvie5vQLDCOiY.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Post Production","country":null,"genres":["Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1578488","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-17T11:08:38.925Z"},{"id":"movie-1403676","slug":"movie-1403676","title":"April X","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3QrpmL3VLFkKwW1VUpq46RhCj3X.jpg","synopsis":"En un futuro cercano fracturado, los hermanos gemelos Bax y April se ven separados por fuerzas que ninguno de los dos comprende del todo. Observamos a Bax caer en la locura, desvelando la frontera entre la identidad y los recuerdos.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Suspense","Ciencia ficción","Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1403676","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-17T11:08:39.236Z"},{"id":"movie-1798313","slug":"movie-1798313","title":"Oye Chill Maar","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oZN8yKQoQROH7zdjBGx2gOZ4Xal.jpg","synopsi