uel que ose entrar en su bosque. Casas, coches... Nada es refugio. Nadie está a salvo.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1049942","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-17T11:09:31.054Z"},{"id":"movie-1536008","slug":"movie-1536008","title":"คำสารภาพของหมอผี","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eTcA1UKFhpKIyELXv4hOIUi8rX.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1536008","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-17T11:09:31.379Z"},{"id":"movie-1064307","slug":"movie-1064307","title":"Spermageddon","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jYJJDtrGBAr1U9WBVuq809FyYQj.jpg","synopsis":"Los adolescentes Jens y Lisa están a punto de experimentar su primera relación sexual. Dentro del cuerpo de Jens, el Spermageddon se acerca, un evento para el que el espermatozoide Simon el Semen y sus amigos han estado preparándose duramente. En esta carrera donde solo puede ganar uno, deberán sortear todo tipo de obstáculos inesperados que les harán la vida imposible.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Animación","Aventura","Fantasía","Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1064307","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2024,"updatedAt":"2026-10-17T11:09:31.693Z"},{"id":"movie-866398","slug":"movie-866398","title":"Beekeeper: El protector","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gBdhYoROX6SHE3vVnBfEHI7Ojma.jpg","synopsis":"La brutal campaña de venganza de Adam Clay adquiere tintes nacionales tras revelarse que es un antiguo agente de una poderosa organización clandestina conocida como \"Beekeeper\".","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Crimen","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/866398","type":"flyflix","contentType":"mo