udiante de último año de secundaria al cual la vida no le ha mostrado su mejor lado. Su familia solo la conforman él y su padre, que es adicto al alcohol y al juego. De camino hacia la escuela conoce a Furukawa Nagisa y a partir de ese momento su vida cambia para mejor; conoce a más amigos los cuales cuentan sus problemas y Okazaki, al darse cuenta de que no solo él tiene problemas, comienza a ayudarlos.","status":"Finalizado","country":null,"genres":["Animación","Comedia","Drama","Sci-Fi & Fantasy"],"totalEpisodes":44,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/24835-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2007,"updatedAt":"2026-10-17T11:23:30.756Z"},{"id":"tv-314647","slug":"tv-314647","title":"GIFT","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5bjdruO6jpKc4xz1PQjZudwxvYA.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Finalizado","country":null,"genres":["Drama"],"totalEpisodes":10,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/314647-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-17T11:23:31.206Z"},{"id":"tv-205594","slug":"tv-205594","title":"快乐再出发","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vTx6k284A3NI9slDqCgGwodrpqk.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"En emisión","country":null,"genres":["Comedia","Reality"],"totalEpisodes":31,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/205594-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2022,"updatedAt":"2026-10-17T11:23:31.505Z"},{"id":"tv-284884","slug":"tv-284884","title":"직장인들","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qCFutqGTCcX9SvfmBfhCwBQ086h.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"En emisión","country":null,"genres":["Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":20,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/284884-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-17T11:23:31.798Z"},{"id":"tv-238458","slug":"tv-238458","title":"Cashman","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/h73FVzJZlgo0ZrHNqLl0swAzwHm.jpg","synopsis":"Un hombre común hereda el don de una fuerza descomunal, pero un enemigo busca arrebatárselo. Lo peor 